MSD client
----------

GET /api/msd, POST /api/msd/write, POST /api/msd/write_remote,
POST /api/msd/set_params, POST /api/msd/set_connected, and
POST /api/msd/remove follow the PiKVM MSD HTTP API as documented at
https://docs.pikvm.org/api/ (read 2026-10-17) and as implemented in
pikvm/kvmd v4.227
(https://github.com/pikvm/kvmd/commit/0dd244fabc8ca5731fc594311211a5ab8544c85a),
in particular kvmd/apps/kvmd/api/msd.py, kvmd/plugins/msd/otg/storage.py,
kvmd/plugins/msd/__init__.py, and kvmd/htserver.py. Those files were
read as API facts. The mock reproduces kvmd error class names and the
messages those classes define, which is GPL-compatible: the source is
pikvm/kvmd v4.227
(https://github.com/pikvm/kvmd/commit/0dd244fabc8ca5731fc594311211a5ab8544c85a).
No code from another pikvm_mcp_server fork was added for these methods.

